# Explorations (website)

When editing `src/explorations/` or shared `src/eComponents/`. Canonical metadata: [eip-canonical-data.mdc](./eip-canonical-data.mdc). Layout and CSS: [exploration-design.mdc](./exploration-design.mdc).

## Building blocks

1. Check [available-e-components.md](../../website-docs/contributing/available-e-components.md) before custom UI.
2. One primary E-Component shell per exploration unless explicitly designing a new shared pattern. **Future-driven shared components:** when design identifies reusable receipt/log/state UI (or similar) useful beyond this EIP, implement the E-Component sub-round first (see [add-exploration skill](../skills/add-exploration/SKILL.md)), then integrate.
3. Extension UI goes **inside** E-Component slots (`#below`, `#result`) — not as siblings (provide/inject is descendant-only).
4. **Result slot must match `changeNature`** — gas compare only for `repricing`; validity/output for `new-capability` precompiles.

## Deps

Import third-party libraries only in the exploration folder (or exploration-local modules), not in E-Components.

## Registration

Every new exploration needs an import in `src/explorations/REGISTRY.ts` or it will not appear in nav.

**Latest on the home page:** prepend the id to `FEATURED_EXPLORATION_IDS` in `src/views/homeCatalog.ts`. `latestExplorationIds()` is the first 3 — new exploration is Latest; the previous third Latest moves to the Catalog row.

**Engagement lexicon:** live ids need a `problem_slices` row in `social/watchlist.yml` ([add-exploration](../skills/add-exploration/SKILL.md)). On `docsStatus: sunset`, remove that row and the `eip_number_fallback` id. Do not rewrite the x-engagement skill for catalog churn.

## Cover art

Every exploration ships `image.webp` imported from `info.ts`. Playbook: [cover-image skill](../skills/cover-image/SKILL.md). Page layout (`imageBoxHeight` vs `rightPanel`): [exploration-design.mdc](./exploration-design.mdc).

## Procedure

New exploration workflow: [round-trip-protocol-change](../skills/round-trip-protocol-change/SKILL.md) (brief → exploration → MCP → optional comic). Subskills: [brief-protocol-change](../skills/brief-protocol-change/SKILL.md) → [add-exploration](../skills/add-exploration/SKILL.md) + [adding-an-exploration.md](../../website-docs/contributing/adding-an-exploration.md). Comic: [bro-bruh-comic](../skills/bro-bruh-comic/SKILL.md) (`design/comics/`, not the exploration folder).

Tests passing is the quality bar, not the pedagogy bar — human must review intro, usage, and examples.
